    "aliases": ["RAVEL"],
    "description": "For an entity (a city) with attributes (its country, its language), the eval changes the latents for one attribute. The model's answer for that attribute must change (cause) and the answers for the other attributes must not (isolation). Disentanglement is the mean of the two.",
